  "body": "I integrated @BrianAnakPintar with normal UDB directory for this. I also added the generation of riscv-opcodes outputs, such as encodings.out.h that is what @ayosher was looking for if I am not in error. I added a README.md for detailed instructions.\r\n\r\n@ayosher Until next meeting I won't have enough bandwidth to test this with SPIKE and Qualcomm new extensions, but to do so, you should just go to the folder `/ext/opcodes_maker` and run `make YAML_DIR=../../cfgs/qc_iu/arch_overlay/inst/` and look for `output/encoding.out.h` as an input for SPIKE.",
  "created_at": "2025-01-30T13:27:47Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-01-22T17:59:13Z",
  "closed_at": "2025-03-31T08:52:51Z",
