    "id": 12569382,
    "node_id": "MI_kwDOMVmcaM4Av8sm",
    "number": 3,
    "title": "Instruction appendix, Phase 1",
    "description": "Phase 1 shall include:\r\n\r\n- Integration of riscv-isa-manual repo into UDB\r\n- Generated ISA Manual PDF with complete instruction appendix\r\n- Generated ISA Manual HTML using Antora with complete instruction appendix\r\n\r\nIn the appendix, we will include, for each instruction:\r\n\r\n- Mnemonic / name\r\n- Long name (e.g, \"Signed Multiply\")\r\n- Synopsis\r\n- Encoding, without opcode field names\r\n- Decode variables (name and position, no 'type')\r\n- Defining extension(s)\r\n- Defining profile(s)",
